.     * Compute standard errors and CI bounds
.     gen se      = sqrt((informal2 * (1 - informal2)) / N)

.     gen ub      = informal2 + 1.96 * se

.     gen lb      = informal2 - 1.96 * se

.     replace ub  = min(ub, 1)
